            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "¿Tu nodo está saliendo? Revisa cualquier nodo, o espera el primer advert de uno nuevo"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Is your node getting out? See which observers hear it, and what to fix if something looks wrong." : {
      "localizations" : {
